<rml>
<head>
	<title>UMG events: second document</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="/ArcRmlUISamples/UI/Rml/Shared/Samples.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="UmgEvents.rcss"/>
</head>
<body>
	<div class="ue-card">
		<h1 class="ue-title">Second document</h1>
		<p>The graph swapped the document with Set Document. The widget and its place on the screen stayed.</p>
		<div class="ue-buttons">
			<button id="ue-back" class="ue-button" data-action="open:/ArcRmlUISamples/UI/Rml/UmgEvents/UmgEvents.rml">Back to the first document</button>
			<button class="ue-button" data-action="close">Close</button>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
